<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's slain Supreme Leader, Ali Khamenei, has returned to Qom... his coffin carried by helicopter to the holy city ahead of burial.</s> <s>Thirty-six years he held the center of a theocratic state, and his named successor, his son Mojtaba, hasn't been seen in public since the February assassination.</s> <s>Whether the Guardian Council and the Revolutionary Guard can manage this succession will decide if Iran hardens, fractures, or opens.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Venezuela, coffins now fill a trench two hectares wide near the port of La Guaira, after twin earthquakes overwhelmed the country's capacity to bury its dead individually.</s> <s>Officials confirm more than three thousand dead and forty-one thousand missing, but the United Nations warns the true toll could reach ten thousand.</s> <s>Volunteer networks, not the state, are leading the rescue in a country whose seismic infrastructure officials themselves call practically nonexistent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A quiet purge is clearing the top of China's military, and Xi Jinping is refilling the seats with his own loyalists.</s> <s>The body he's reshaping, the Central Military Commission, commands the armed forces and would direct any move against Taiwan.</s> <s>Beijing hasn't named who's been removed or who'll replace them, but the pattern reveals how deeply Xi distrusts even the officers he once appointed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Bangladesh, a bomb struck the stage of a student-led rally in Savar, wounding three as the politician Nahid Islam was speaking.</s> <s>Islam is a leading face of the movement that toppled Sheikh Hasina in twenty twenty-four, and his party grew directly from that revolt.</s> <s>No perpetrators have been named, and the attack signals how fragile the post-Hasina order remains ahead of a contested transition.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Philippines opened the impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Duterte, hours after senators arrested one of her allies.</s> <s>She's accused of misusing public funds and threatening the life of President Marcos, and conviction needs sixteen of the Senate's twenty-four members.</s> <s>A guilty verdict would bar her from the twenty twenty-eight presidential race, so this is less about the charges than about who inherits the country's dynastic politics.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Cyprus, the so-called Board of Peace met Gaza's new technocratic committee, and nothing moved.</s> <s>Israel still blocks that committee from entering Gaza while occupying seventy percent of the strip beyond the ceasefire's yellow line.</s> <s>A governance structure for Palestinians is being assembled around them by outside mediators, even as the ceasefire itself falters.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Samsung earned fifty-eight billion dollars in a single quarter, more profit than it made in the previous two years combined.</s> <s>Demand for memory chips to feed AI data centers drove the South Korean firm's profit up nearly twentyfold.</s> <s>Analysts expect the shortage to stay tight through twenty twenty-eight, a reminder of how narrowly the global tech economy now rests on a handful of chipmakers.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Canada chose Germany over South Korea to build twelve new submarines, picking ThyssenKrupp Marine Systems over the rival Hanwha Ocean.</s> <s>Ottawa favored alignment with NATO as Prime Minister Carney lifts defence spending toward five percent of national output by twenty thirty-five.</s> <s>Talks with the German firm could still collapse, leaving the Korean bidder waiting in reserve.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan, the anti-graft bureau has seized the Bahria Icon Tower in Karachi, built with roughly eight billion rupees of laundered money.</s> <s>A court confirmed the attachment in the money-laundering case against the property tycoon Malik Riaz.</s> <s>Whether the seizure becomes a real conviction, or quietly reverses, will test how far the bureau can reach into the country's most powerful men.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Indian hill town of Lonavla recorded six hundred and seventy millimeters of rain in a single day.</s> <s>A weather scientist classed it a one-in-a-thousand-year event, meaning it had a chance of just one-tenth of one percent of falling on any given day.</s> <s>That return-period language is how climatologists warn that events once called freak are now arriving inside a single human lifetime.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Britain built a model that reads a tumor's genetics from an MRI scan alone, no surgery required.</s> <s>Trained on more than thirteen hundred brain metastases from lung cancer patients, it reached eighty-three percent accuracy in spotting the mutations that guide targeted therapy.</s> <s>Because biopsying a brain tumor is dangerous, validated imaging could let far more patients skip the knife entirely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mathematicians in the United States have shown that verifying an answer can itself demand a quantum computer.</s> <s>Some proofs, they found, carry a power that no classical check can ever match.</s> <s>The result sharpens the boundary between what quantum and classical machines can do, narrowing which real-world problems we must treat as fundamentally hard.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israel says it wants to build offensive lasers in space, and to be the first country to do it.</s> <s>The plan builds on Iron Beam, the US-funded laser tested alongside Iron Dome, and echoes Washington's own Golden Dome interceptor idea.</s> <s>No state has yet openly claimed offensive space weapons, and their cheap cost per shot may quietly lower the threshold for war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Near Tokyo, a single student allegedly canceled forty-six thousand paid accounts on an anime streaming platform.</s> <s>Japanese police say he exploited a broken access-control flaw, a service that trusted requests it never bothered to check.</s> <s>Police haven't said whether the platform has since patched the hole that let one person cost it so much.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Italy has switched on its own eyes in orbit, a constellation of fifteen satellites now feeding imagery to government users.</s> <s>The one-point-one-billion-euro network, called IRIDE, serves civil protection and security, built for national sensing rather than purchased from abroad.</s> <s>Thirty-seven more satellites remain to launch, part of a wider push by nations to own the data they once had to buy.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>